            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The infiltration test has shown air leakage from the windows, electrical receptacles, and the main floor bathroom fan. We recommend the installation of insulation for electrical receptacles and outlets. Concerning the windows, we recommend following the suggested recommendation.</airSeal>
                <ceilings>During the assessment, we notice that the insulation level of the new section attic was R-32, we recommend the addition of insulation to meet the city of Whitehorse standard of R-60. Concerning the old section, we recommend meeting the same insulation level to meet the city standard.</ceilings>
                <foundation>We recommend the addition of insulation on the old section (1985) foundation walls to reach a level of R-20.</foundation>
                <windows>During the assessment, we notice that some windows were broken and the presence of condensation. We recommend the replacement of the obsolete units by Energy Star products.</windows>
            </RURComments>
